# CICD-SEC-1 / CICD-SEC-4: require explicit review on changes to CI/CD
# pipeline definitions and CI-executed scripts, since these files control
# what code runs with pipeline-level privileges (Poisoned Pipeline Execution
# surface). GitHub only enforces this once branch protection + "Require
# review from Code Owners" is enabled on the target branch (see
# docs/security/OWASP_CICD_AUDIT_AND_INFRA_CHECKLIST.md).

